      "content": "wait, why are you talking about goblins and tribes? i'm actually really stressed out here and i'm not looking for metaphors or a fantasy story. i'm just a student trying to pass my dissertation. can you please just ignore the goblin stuff and give me real, practical advice on how to actually manage these citations in a professional, academic way? i need to know how to keep the different formatting rules from getting tangled up in my actual document.",
